@startuml state-machine
!include _theme.puml
hide empty description
skinparam nodesep 46
skinparam ranksep 40

[*] -down-> idle
idle -down-> loading : load()

loading -down-> buffering : ready [play wanted]
loading -down-> paused : ready [paused]
buffering -down-> playing : audio flowing
playing -up-> buffering : stall > 500 ms ·\nsilent stall
playing -up-> paused : pause() · interruption ·\noutput disconnected
paused -left-> buffering : play()
paused -up-> loading : play() · released or\nlive drift > 5 s

buffering -left-> reconnecting : dead socket · offline ·\nstall > 20 s
playing -left-> reconnecting : stream dropped
reconnecting -up-> loading : backoff elapsed ·\nnetwork restored

playing -down-> ended : end of file
ended -up-> buffering : play()

loading -left-> error : unrecoverable\n(404, format)
reconnecting -up-> error : gave up (10 min)
error -right-> loading : play()

paused -down-> stopped : stop()
stopped -up-> loading : play()

state playing #EEF4FC
state reconnecting #FFF3EA
state error #FBECEC

note right of idle
  From any state: reset() → idle,
  stop() → stopped, pause() → paused.
  A recoverable failure while paused
  waits for the next play().
end note
@enduml
